			"notes": "**Eldritch Surge 1.7.1 — Changes from 1.7.0**\n\n- **Correct maximum enchantment levels:** the Advanced Enchanting Table now displays each enchantment’s actual maximum level. The ritual structure is still required to apply levels above 1.\n- **Cleaner item tooltips:** enchantment descriptions no longer appear all at once.\n- **Hoverable enchantment details:** inventory items and the Advanced Table now feature a panel that displays the description of the highlighted enchantment. Moving the cursor into the description keeps it open.\n- **Effect categories:** added groups such as damage, protection, movement, and fishing for datapacks and integrations. These do not introduce new incompatibilities.\n- **Curse classification fixes:** Fragility, Perish, Spider, Target, and The Forest are now included in Minecraft’s curse tag.\n- **26.4 Snapshot 7 support:** adapted inventory slots and interface code, with separate JARs for Minecraft 26.3 and 26.4 Snapshot 7."
		},
